            <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.10.4</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[- Going full screen, for example with a video, no longer moves your windows on the strip or makes them slide back when you return.
- Apps that show a small loading window at launch, like Slack, now take their normal place on the strip.
]]></description>
