            <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.10.2</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[- Report a problem now addresses the email to hello@butterflyformac.com.
- Activating a license no longer sends your computer's name.
- Clearer wording about what Butterfly checks online.
- Diagnostic links no longer work in release builds.
]]></description>
